> Identity projections reduce to plain attention

One head and identity query/key/value/output projections preserve the plain-attention calculation. The two scalar-valued tokens2 and4 share zero query logits, so each output coordinate becomes3.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/multi_head_attention_worked.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
#include <dm/dm.hpp>
int main(){namespace n=dm::nn;namespace m=n::models;std::filesystem::create_directories("build");n::ParameterStore p(1);auto query=n::zeros({1,1,8}),kv=n::concat({n::full({1,1,8},2),n::full({1,1,8},4)},1);n::MultiHeadOptions o;o.impl=n::AttentionImpl::Plain;o.need_weights=true;n::multi_head_attention(p,"mha",query,kv,1,o);for(auto& key:p.names())p.set(key,n::eye(8));auto path=n::multi_head_attention(p,"mha",query,kv,1,o);auto values=path.output.reshape({8});if(n::max(n::abs(values-3.)).item()>1e-6)return 1;
std::print("| coordinate | computed value |\n|---:|---:|\n");auto v=values.to_vector<double>();for(size_t i=0;i<v.size();++i)std::print("| {} | {:.9f} |\n",i,v[i]);n::save_npz("build/multi_head_attention_worked.npz",{{"values",values}});dm::graphics::RPlot::create().bars(n::arange(0,std::int64_t(v.size())).to_vector<double>(),v,"native values",{37,99,235}).title("Identity projections reduce to plain attention").size(1000,550).save_svg("build/multi_head_attention_worked.svg");}
```
